OL,5,G0820 James Martin's American Adventure
OL,6,     FThe chef heads towards Louisiana's
OL,7,     Fswamplands, where he ditches his
OL,8,     Fcar for a high-speed boat. He
OL,9,     Ftravels to the nearby city of
OL,10,     FLafayette, where he visits the
OL,11,     Ffamily run smokehouse Johnson's
OL,12,     FBoucaniere, and samples some of
OL,13,     Ftheir traditional home-made
OL,14,     Fsausage. James also tries ice
OL,15,     Fcream from the famous Borden's ice
OL,16,     Fcream parlour, before heading back
OL,17,     Fto the swamps to cook one final
OL,18,     Fdish
